    <h1>THE GREAT GATSBY</h1>

    <p class="byline">By F. Scott Fitzgerald</p>

    <p>Chapter 1</p>

    <p>In my younger and more vulnerable years my father gave me some advice that I’ve been turning over in my mind ever since.</p>

    <p>Whenever you feel like criticizing any one, just remember that all the people in this world haven’t had the same advantages that you’ve had.</p>

    <div class="placeholder" style="height: 180px;">
